        "Content": "- Modern extended family room to the rear\r\n- Utility room & WC\r\n- Sunny, west facing rear garden\r\n- Gas fired central heating\r\n- Mostly triple glazed windows (double glazed in kitchen & extension)\r\n- Off-street parking for 2 cars\r\n- Gated side entrance\r\n- Close to bus and DART stations\r\n- Close to Bayside Shopping Centre, schools & seafront\r\n- Garden shed"
